# Astro
node_modules/
dist/
.astro/

# Synced from assets/ by `prebuild`/`precheck` in package.json. Astro serves files
# verbatim from public/ and cannot be pointed at assets/, so this directory is a build
# artifact rather than a source; committing it would put a second copy of every asset in
# the repo that drifts the moment someone edits assets/ and forgets to re-copy.
public/
